{"c":[{"name":"20261022T042746Z-f215752aa66f27d4","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, vss never loaded (autoload off): a file with the HNSW index, with or without a .wal from a killed 1.5.4 embed, opens, keeps every row, runs exact array_cosine_distance, DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, checkpoint.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043947Z-1bad7ee0aac20fca","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, live copy (133,793 vectors): exact semantic as join messages then QUALIFY row_number() takes 1.3 s on 2.0.0 (1.7 s on 1.5.4); group-by-min, LIMIT, then join messages takes 153 ms (205 ms). Role scope: 1.15 s vs 363 ms. Dedup before joining text.","type":"note"}]}
